EN:
Another {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fireworks show{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} will be held
at the same time next week!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}If you find time in your schedule,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
you should check it out!

TRANSLATION:
Gelecek{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} hafta aynı{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} saatte bir
havai fişek gösterisi daha{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
olacak! Programında yer{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
açabilirsen mutlaka gel!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ça peut paraître un peu prématuré,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
mais j'attends déjà les feux
d'artifice de la semaine prochaine !

EN:
I'll put a lot of effort into next
week's {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fireworks show{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} as well,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}so please come see it!

FR:
Je vais travailler d'arrache-pied{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
pour que les feux d'artifice de la{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
semaine prochaine soient aussi bien.

TRANSLATION:
Gelecek haftaki gösteri için de{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
elimden geleni{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} yapacağım{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}. Lütfen
yine gel!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Gracias por acercarte a {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
a ver los fuegos artificiales.
¡Ha sido todo un detalle!

IT:
Non ci saranno altri spettacoli
di{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} fuochi d'artificio{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} quest'anno.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Se ne riparla l'anno prossimo!

TRANSLATION:
Bu yılın{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} bütün havai{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} fişek
gösterileri bitti{{TAG:0007:0001:}}.{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Ama üzülme;
gelecek yıl yine dönecekler!

EN:
When the {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fireworks shows{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} are over,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
I get the feeling fall is just around
the corner!

TRANSLATION:
Havai{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} fişek gösterileri{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} sona{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
erince sonbaharın kapıda
olduğunu hissediyorum.

EN:
Wow, trying to get ready for bed
after an exciting {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}fireworks show{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
is never easy{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.

IT:
Uau, andare a letto dopo uno
spettacolo di fuochi d'artificio{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}così fuffoso non è affatto facile{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.

TRANSLATION:
Böyle heyecanlı bir gösteriden
sonra yatmaya{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} hazırlanmak hiç{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
kolay olmuyor{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}'ın yılın son havai{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}} fişek
gösterisini bizimle izleyecek{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
misafirimiz olduğu için çok mutluyum!
